  },
  {
    "id": "08_08",
    "text": "这要回到底层逻辑：大语言模型本质上是一个强大的概率预测工具。",
    "visual": {
      "type": "manim",
      "prompt": "Show a neural network with arrows labeled 'next token probability' and a dice icon beside it, clean 3D cartoon style",
      "source": null,
      "scene_class": "ProbabilityPredictor",
      "fallback": null
    },
    "avatar": {
      "mode": "hidden",
      "scale": 0.3
    },
    "audio": {
      "mode": "auto",
      "override": null
    },
    "transition": "crossfade"
  },
  {
    "id": "09_09",
    "text": "也就是一个高级的‘文字接龙’机器。",
    "visual": {
      "type": "clipart",
      "prompt": null,
      "source": "assets/manual/09文字接龙.png",
      "scene_class": null,
      "fallback": null
    },
    "avatar": {
      "mode": "hidden",
      "scale": 0.3
    },
    "audio": {
      "mode": "auto",
      "override": null
    },
    "transition": "crossfade"
  },
  {
    "id": "10_10",
    "text": "无事实数据库：AI 的大脑里并没有像人类一样存放着一个绝对真实的‘事实数据库’。",
    "visual": {
      "type": "solid_bg",
      "prompt": "无事实库",
      "source": null,
      "scene_class": null,
      "fallback": null
    },
    "avatar": {
      "mode": "pip_br",
      "scale": 0.3
    },
    "audio": {
      "mode": "auto",
      "override": null
    },
    "transition": "crossfade"
  },
  {
    "id": "11_11",
    "text": "概率预测：它回答问题，是根据输入的 Prompt 和训练阶段见过的海量文本，计算出下一个最有可能出现的词汇。",
    "visual": {
      "type": "manim",
      "prompt": "Animated flow: 'Prompt → Token Embedding → Probability Distribution → Top-1 Token', all in clean 3D cartoon style",
      "source": null,
      "scene_class": "NextTokenPrediction",
      "fallback": null
    },
    "avatar": {
      "mode": "hidden",
      "scale": 0.3
    },
    "audio": {
      "mode": "auto",
      "override": null
    },
    "transition": "crossfade"
  },
  {
    "id": "12_12",
    "text": "缺乏坦诚：当遇到‘没见过’或‘记忆模糊’的知识点时，它通常不会像人类那样坦诚地说‘我不知道’。",
    "visual": {
      "type": "clipart",
      "prompt": null,
      "source": "assets/manual/12缺乏坦诚.png",
      "scene_class": null,
      "fallback": null
    },
    "avatar": {
      "mode": "hidden",
      "scale": 0.3
    },
    "audio": {
      "mode": "auto",
      "override": null
    },
    "transition": "crossfade"
  },
  {
    "id": "13_13",
    "text": "相反，它会顺着语言的概率惯性，硬生生地‘顺’出一个听起来合理、符合语法的句子。",
    "visual": {
      "type": "solid_bg",
      "prompt": "顺出答案",
      "source": null,
      "scene_class": null,
      "fallback": null
    },
    "avatar": {
      "mode": "pip_br",
      "scale": 0.3
    },
    "audio": {
      "mode": "auto",
      "override": null
    },
    "transition": "crossfade"
  },
