  {
    "id": "15_15",
    "text": "提问：请介绍一下鲁迅在2008年北京奥运会上发表的演讲。",
    "visual": {
      "type": "ai_image",
      "prompt": "Cartoon-style illustration of a confused student asking a question to an AI robot holding a scroll labeled '2008 Olympics'. Clean background, high quality 3D realistic cartoon style, bright lighting",
      "source": null,
      "scene_class": null,
      "fallback": null
    },
    "avatar": {
      "mode": "hidden",
      "scale": 0.3
    },
    "audio": {
      "mode": "auto",
      "override": null
    },
    "transition": "crossfade"
  },
  {
    "id": "16_16ai",
    "text": "AI 回答：鲁迅在2008年北京奥运会上的演讲慷慨激昂，他强调了体育精神与民族觉醒的深刻联系……",
    "visual": {
      "type": "ai_image",
      "prompt": "Cartoon-style AI robot speaking confidently at an Olympic stadium podium, with floating fake text bubbles showing '《青年与体育》' and '1936–2008', high quality 3D realistic cartoon style, bright and clean",
      "source": null,
      "scene_class": null,
      "fallback": null
    },
    "avatar": {
      "mode": "hidden",
      "scale": 0.3
    },
    "audio": {
      "mode": "auto",
      "override": null
    },
    "transition": "crossfade"
  },
  {
    "id": "17_17",
    "text": "分析：AI 逻辑通顺、文笔流畅，但事实错得离谱——鲁迅先生早在1936年就逝世了。",
    "visual": {
      "type": "solid_bg",
      "prompt": "1936 ≠ 2008",
      "source": null,
      "scene_class": null,
      "fallback": null
    },
    "avatar": {
      "mode": "pip_br",
